# 1.03's 572 / 591 / 663 (the same records: 11 sids, 3 sids, one mono 59452-byte record); the mode asked for 592
# at 10 s left, 573 at 5..1 and 664 at the end in the emulator on the stock 1.04 card (rig 4, muted)
