# ---- events: the framework's event bus, each seen firing in the emulator 2026-10-01 (PAD-306): 1.04 inserted one
# bus id at 0x46, so 1.03's ids from 0x46 up are one higher here (game_start 0x4d -> 0x4e, game_over 0x47 -> 0x48,
# tilt 0xc5 -> 0xc6, tilt_warning 0xc7 -> 0xc8; the same functions dispatch them); 0x25, 0x34 and 0x28 are unchanged
event game_start     0x4e
event ball_start     0x25
event ball_end       0x34
event bonus_end      0x28
event tilt_warning   0xc8
event tilt           0xc6
event game_over      0x48

